Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.03,0:00:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,HANK:\NOperation lcebreaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.82,0:00:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How we liking that? We never\Nused that before, did we?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.91,0:00:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,lsn't that the name\Nof a breath mint?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.50,0:00:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What?\Nlce Breakers, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.83,0:00:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Breath mint?\NHANK: Nobody's gonna think that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.33,0:00:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Gonna be thinking about\Nsome big-ass ship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.79,0:00:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,in the North Pole\Nbreaking ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.34,0:00:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Says you. l'm gonna be thinking\NOperation Breath Mint.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.51,0:00:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm thinking\NOperation Breath Mint
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.09,0:00:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,every time you and me\Nare on a stakeout together,\Nall right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.51,0:00:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Your breath can knock a buzzard\Noff a shit wagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.51,0:00:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Operation TBD.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.89,0:00:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for nothing, Gom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.18,0:00:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, say hello to\NDomingo Gallardo Molina.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.77,0:00:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A.k.a. Krazy-8. Way smarter\Nthan your average cheese eater.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.03,0:00:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,l turned him out\Nwhen he was street level,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.65,0:00:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but this dude's\Nlike The Jeffersons,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.53,0:00:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,\N\Nmoving on up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.70,0:00:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Every small-time dealer\Nhe'd throw at us,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.24,0:00:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,he'd end up snaking\Nall their customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.99,0:00:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it turns out\Nthat he's missing,\Npresumed dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.70,0:00:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Found his car\Nout in the boonies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.75,0:01:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Last guy he ratted out\Nwas none other than his cousin,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.04,0:01:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Emilio Koyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.50,0:01:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You thinking the cousin\Nfound out and took revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.71,0:01:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,HANK:\NCould be. Turns out\Nhe's missing too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.38,0:01:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And normally l'd say\Nsomeone did the world a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.97,0:01:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But our snitch's car, turns out\Nwe find two grams of meth in it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.06,0:01:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,we take it to the lab,\Nthey come back,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.27,0:01:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,they tell us it is the purest\Nthey've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.23,0:01:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninety-nine-point-one percent.\N[WHlSTLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.90,0:01:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, our chemist is\Nblown away. Said he couldn't\Ndo the same thing better.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.49,0:01:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Worse yet, it didn't come out\Nof some super lab in Mexico,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.03,0:01:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,we're thinking this was\Ncooked right here in\Nthe Land of Enchantment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.37,0:01:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Car was abandoned at\Nwhat appears to be a cook site.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.04,0:01:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the, uh,\Nonly other thing left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.25,0:01:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sending it off\Nto Quantico,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.71,0:01:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,see if they can pull\Nsomething off it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.38,0:01:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Meantime, our guys swabbed\Nthe filter element
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.63,0:01:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and found the same 99. 1 meth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.76,0:01:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So be on notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.14,0:01:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We got new players in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.35,0:01:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, we don't know who they are,\Nor where they come from,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.06,0:02:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but they possess\Nan extremely high skill set.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.69,0:02:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, personally,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.61,0:02:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking Albuquerque\Njust might have a new kingpin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.36,0:02:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[SPlTS]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.57,0:02:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.51,0:02:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[HlSSlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.02,0:02:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesus, Walt, you're burning\Nthe shit out of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.56,0:02:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.98,0:02:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sky,\Nyou got any more chicken?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.57,0:02:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Emeril here\Nis gonna need a fresh pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.74,0:02:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Bam.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.70,0:02:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,HANK:\NAll right, looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.16,0:02:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,ls this low-fat mayonnaise\Nin the coleslaw?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.08,0:03:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, l-- l don't know,\Nit's store-bought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.41,0:03:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, uh, Hank,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.21,0:03:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,you need another beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.42,0:03:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Does the pope\Nshit in his hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.13,0:03:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, l don't think\Nthat he does, Hank,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.34,0:03:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and l think everybody\Nwould like it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.05,0:03:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,if you'd stop saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.63,0:03:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Marie, some more wine, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.05,0:03:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm all right, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.22,0:03:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.\NHey, l want a beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.01,0:03:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, l want Shania Twain\Nto give me a tuggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.31,0:03:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess what.\Nlt ain't happening either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.39,0:03:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How about some more soda, hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.89,0:03:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.14,0:03:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey, do you need anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.31,0:03:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm. No, Walt,\Nthank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.94,0:03:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.66,0:03:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.75,0:03:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT JR. :\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What, are you\Nkidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.05,0:03:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like\Na damn movie star, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.55,0:03:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Girls gotta be lining up\Nleft and right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.22,0:04:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him how\Ngood-looking he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.93,0:04:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.22,0:04:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't wanna be fricking\Nadorable, he wants to be hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.23,0:04:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, see what\Nl'm talking about?\NThat's female perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.89,0:04:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,She's supposed to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.73,0:04:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,HANK:\NLook, a guy doesn't\Ngotta look like, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.15,0:04:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,you know, Charlton Heston--\Nl'm talking Moses days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.07,0:04:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,--to get a girl, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.70,0:04:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You just gotta have confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.74,0:04:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Confidence and, uh--\NAnd persistence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.58,0:04:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay? That's what\Nl'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.08,0:04:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,l chased your aunt Marie here\Nall over creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.75,0:04:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,l kept bugging her for a date,\Nshe kept saying no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.67,0:04:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What, l asked you,\Nlike, 50 times?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.50,0:04:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was before they\Ntightened the stalking laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.59,0:04:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHUCKLES SARCASTlCALLY]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.09,0:04:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,HANK: Anyway, how about\Nyour dad here? That there's\Na good story, Walt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.60,0:04:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him how you met Skyler.\NUh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.27,0:04:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT JR. :\NMom was a waitress
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.93,0:04:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,in Los Alamos, and Dad said\Nthat thing to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.90,0:04:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, actually, your mother\Nwasn't a waitress,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.69,0:04:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,it was a summer job,\Nand, um, she was the hostess
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.11,0:05:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and she also worked\Nthe cash register.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.87,0:05:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And l used to\Ngo in there a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.99,0:05:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,because it was close enough\Nto the lab
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.75,0:05:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,where l could ride my bicycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.75,0:05:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And once l noticed her,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.46,0:05:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,it got to be so that\Nl would only go in
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.25,0:05:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,when l knew she was working.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.05,0:05:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,When it was slow, she would\Nlean against the counter,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.30,0:05:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,doing her crossword puzzles,\Nuh, but kind of hiding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.97,0:05:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Right? Pretending that\Nshe was still working,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.31,0:05:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and once l caught on to that,\Nl would do crossword puzzles
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,while l ate\Nmy grilled-cheese sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.77,0:05:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,lt got so that every day\Nat lunch, we would both be doing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.82,0:05:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The New York Times\Ncrossword puzzle
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.36,0:05:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,1 0 feet from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.83,0:05:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And, uh-- Heh-heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.24,0:05:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Eventually, l caught her\Nlooking over at me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.67,0:05:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,so l began saying:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.79,0:05:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,"Excuse me, um, 1 4 across,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.46,0:06:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,seven-letter word\Nfor whatchamacallit,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.67,0:06:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,uh, may l ask what--?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.63,0:06:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What you wrote down?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.51,0:06:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And, uh, well,\Nthat got us talking,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.85,0:06:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and, uh, boy,\Nl tell you, l was--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.35,0:06:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,l was terrible\Nat those puzzles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.35,0:06:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHUCKLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.69,0:06:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't think that l finished\Neven one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.36,0:06:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But your mother\Nwould do them in ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.74,0:06:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,HANK:\NVery smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.03,0:06:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHUCKLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.28,0:06:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,l bet you didn't think\Nyour old man had it in him, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.99,0:06:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's what\Nl'm talking about,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.70,0:06:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,that's persistence, you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.33,0:06:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you set your cap\Nfor something
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.58,0:06:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,or somebody,\Nyou gotta just, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.88,0:06:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,[SOBBlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.29,0:06:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa. Skyler.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.84,0:06:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, a-- Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.38,0:06:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,MARlE:\NHey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.55,0:06:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh. Honey, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.76,0:06:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.72,0:06:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,[SOBBlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.93,0:06:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,MARlE:\NWhat is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.89,0:06:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[SNlFFLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.10,0:06:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.40,0:07:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,[DOOR OPENS]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.36,0:07:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What's she talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.25,0:07:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.08,0:07:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.92,0:07:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,l have cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.55,0:07:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Lung cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.06,0:07:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.57,0:07:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[ROCK MUSlC PLAYlNG\NOVER HEADPHONES]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.25,0:08:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER:\NAsk him how long he's known.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.92,0:08:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,l guess a month, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.30,0:08:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, for God sakes, Walt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.14,0:08:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just sitting out there\Nhaving a cookout
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.01,0:08:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,like nothing's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.22,0:08:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He made me promise\Nnot to tell anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.14,0:08:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Christ,\Nthese last 48 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.85,0:08:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's the weekend,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.98,0:08:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,so l couldn't even get\Nhis doctor on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.07,0:08:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Buddy, why--? l mean, why\Nwouldn't you wanna tell anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.70,0:08:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER:\NWalt, don't you see
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.78,0:08:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,everybody just wants\Nto help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.70,0:08:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We're family.\NWe get through\Nthese things together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.96,0:08:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,HANK:\NAnd l don't get,\Nyou know, lung cancer?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.92,0:08:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How can that happen?\NYou don't even smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.13,0:08:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, l'm thinking that\Nthis goes back 20 years, maybe,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.84,0:08:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,to the applications lab,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.47,0:08:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,all those chemicals\Nthey had you working around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.55,0:08:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We-- We always took\Nthe proper precautions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.85,0:08:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,One time you complained\Nthat they didn't give you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.18,0:08:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,the right kind of, um,\Nl don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.02,0:09:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,some kind of ventilation hood\Nor something, and-- And--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.06,0:09:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And then the headaches.\NHoney, it wasn't that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.86,0:09:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How do they think\Nthey can get away\Nwith this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.44,0:09:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We should hire\Na lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.07,0:09:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so first\Nlet's deal with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.53,0:09:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so,\Nwhat's the next step for Walt?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.70,0:09:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly\Na second opinion, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.87,0:09:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. Right, absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.67,0:09:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,MARlE:\NOkay, so first thing tomorrow,\Nl talk to my radiologists,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.21,0:09:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,we find you the best,\Nthe oncology dream team.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.55,0:09:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good.\NThat's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.64,0:09:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHUCKLES, SNlFFLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.85,0:09:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.93,0:09:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.56,0:09:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay.\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.90,0:09:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.11,0:09:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[SNlFFLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.82,0:09:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm gonna go\Ncheck on Walt Jr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.03,0:09:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,l, um-- l'm gonna see
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.41,0:10:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,if l can talk him into,\Nl don't know, joining us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.21,0:10:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,l really didn't mean for him\Nto find out that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.88,0:10:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[CLEARS THROAT]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.72,0:10:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.59,0:10:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,whatever happens...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.26,0:10:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,l hope this goes without saying,\Nbut, um, whatever happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.60,0:10:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,l want you to know that, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.15,0:10:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,l'll always take care\Nof your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.95,0:10:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[MOUTHlNG]\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.58,0:10:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[THE PACK'S "FLY" PLAYlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.79,0:10:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[TOlLET FLUSHES]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.34,0:10:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[MEN SPEAKlNG lNDlSTlNCTLY]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.59,0:10:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE:\NYo, check out these, uh,\Nfake Pop-Tarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.60,0:11:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,These are mad tight, yo.\NNo, thanks, man, pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.48,0:11:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Your loss. These are from, like,\NCanada, or something. lmported.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.44,0:11:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, yo, what happened\Nto your hallway, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.69,0:11:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Did, like,\Nthe ceiling fall down, or...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.48,0:11:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, uh, no, man,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.49,0:11:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,l think the house\Nis just settling.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.07,0:11:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, it's been\Ncaving in left and right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.45,0:11:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit me in the eye. Heh-heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.54,0:11:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's bananas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.83,0:11:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, my pops could fix you up,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.33,0:11:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,he's, like, a contractor\Nor something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.83,0:11:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Yeah, right on,\Nl should grab that number.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Jesse,\Nyou still cook a little crystal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.38,0:11:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, could be, yeah.\NYou know, from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.18,0:11:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,PETE:\Nl heard you lost\Nyour partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.18,0:11:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Emilio.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.31,0:11:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't he get locked up?\NMAN: No, man, uh, he's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.85,0:11:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,His cousin bailed him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.27,0:11:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,l think he skipped town\Nor something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.86,0:11:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't know about any of that,\Nl've just been
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.90,0:11:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,kind of doing my own thing\Nthese days, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.36,0:11:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN:\NBut you maybe got\Nsome crystal, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.12,0:12:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Because l could seriously\Ngo for a bowl right now,\Nyou know what l'm saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.78,0:12:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,take the edge off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.12,0:12:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, yeah,\NSunday night bowl, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.87,0:12:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.88,0:12:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, maybe it\Njust so happens that, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.09,0:12:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,l just recently cooked\Nthe best batch ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.09,0:12:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.39,0:12:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. Came up\Nwith this whole new recipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.18,0:12:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's more like a formula.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.43,0:12:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's, like,\Nway, way more chemically--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.98,0:12:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, you know, it's--\Nlt's just the bomb, so. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.90,0:12:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But, you know, l don't know,\Nl've been thinking lately
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.32,0:12:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,l'll just lay off of it\Nfor a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.49,0:12:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,because lately it's been kind of\Nmaking me paranoid, so. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.41,0:12:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, for, like,\Nhealth-wise, just lay off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.96,0:12:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN:\NYo, if you're, uh,\Nnot into sharing, man,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.88,0:12:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,just tell us to piss off,\Nit's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.38,0:12:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need no soap opera.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.59,0:12:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, man, whatever.\NNo, no, it's all good, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.09,0:13:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,l-l'm just saying, uh, hey,\Nl got-- l got plenty of pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.43,0:13:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, l think l'll bounce, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.89,0:13:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sounds about right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.27,0:13:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, yo, yo.\NHey, homes, l'm joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.77,0:13:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, l'm totally joking\Nwith you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.94,0:13:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You kidding? Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Best scante ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.04,0:13:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab that pipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.56,0:13:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHUCKLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.61,0:14:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[CLEARS THROAT]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.74,0:14:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.83,0:14:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.43,0:15:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[BANGlNG ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.55,0:15:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,[BELL RlNGS]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.73,0:15:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[GASPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.77,0:15:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.24,0:16:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,[GASPlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.46,0:16:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,[GROANS]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.80,0:16:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.97,0:16:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.43,0:16:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.39,0:16:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.61,0:16:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER:\NWalt, do you need some help?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.99,0:16:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[DOOR HANDLE RATTLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.20,0:16:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, l'm-- l'm fine, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.20,0:16:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm fine. Just, uh, privacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.00,0:16:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.12,0:17:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.79,0:17:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER:\Nl'm right outside\Nif you need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.84,0:17:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.34,0:17:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.30,0:17:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, any time on Friday\Nis absolutely fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.64,0:17:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much\Nfor working us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.60,0:17:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, can l just put that\Non a credit card?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.69,0:17:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Great. Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.98,0:17:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so we will see you\Nat 1 0:45 on Friday morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.24,0:17:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.03,0:17:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.58,0:17:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.75,0:17:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey, the best oncologist,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.38,0:17:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, not even\Njust in New Mexico,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.00,0:17:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,but one of the top 1 0\Nin the entire nation,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.26,0:17:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,his name is, um, Dr. Delcavoli
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.72,0:17:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and we see him on Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.97,0:17:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[SKYLER SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.68,0:17:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.89,0:17:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, Marie really\Ncame through for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.10,0:18:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,She had her boss call, and. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.44,0:18:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.85,0:18:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, this is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.61,0:18:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,From here on out, l mean,\Nthings are gonna--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.57,0:18:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What's--? What's that we're\Nputting on a credit card?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.11,0:18:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, it's just a deposit\Nkind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.74,0:18:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,How much of a deposit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.03,0:18:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's $5000.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.04,0:18:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Five thousand?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.08,0:18:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.80,0:18:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that, just to start?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.13,0:18:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, just to tell me\Nwhat l already know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.43,0:18:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt, he's not in our HMO, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.10,0:18:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So be it,\Nwe'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.22,0:18:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on,\Ndon't get hung up on money here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.02,0:18:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, we can\Nalways borrow from Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.02,0:18:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.28,0:18:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No, l just...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.94,0:18:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not gonna do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.28,0:18:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[SKYLER SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.49,0:18:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe we can ask your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.70,0:19:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you even called her yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.25,0:19:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt, regardless, you're gonna\Nhave to tell her about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.79,0:19:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm willing to do it, but l--\Nl'll call. l'll call.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.30,0:19:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, look,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.13,0:19:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't even want us\Nthinking about money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.09,0:19:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Money is not\Nthe issue here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.31,0:19:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's not.\Nl know. l know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.10,0:19:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.69,0:19:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.31,0:19:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.69,0:19:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,l'll take care of the deposit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.32,0:19:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.49,0:19:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.16,0:19:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,l'll, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.99,0:19:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,l'll borrow it from my pension.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.19,0:20:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[DUCT CLANGS]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.40,0:20:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.28,0:20:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Heh-heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.03,0:20:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, pal, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.91,0:20:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, yeah, no,\Nl thought l heard mice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.58,0:20:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh. Boy, that's--\NThat's all we need, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.37,0:20:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[GRUNTS]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.54,0:20:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's up, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.67,0:20:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's wrong\Nwith you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.88,0:20:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.05,0:20:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're-- You're acting all...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.55,0:20:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're... You--
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.89,0:20:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all.. .\NWhy are you acting so weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.52,0:20:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Son.\NYou're--
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.73,0:20:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You're acting like\Nnothing is going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.61,0:20:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[SCOFFS]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.87,0:21:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.53,0:21:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlREN WAlLlNG lN DlSTANCE]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.37,0:21:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[WHlSPERS]\NOh, no, please.\NPlease, please, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.43,0:22:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[EXHALES SHARPLY]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.14,0:22:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[LAUGHS, THEN COUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.34,0:22:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[SAY ANYTHlNG'S\N"BABY GlRL, l'M A BLUR"\NPLAYlNG ON CAR STEREO]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.42,0:22:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, no, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.72,0:22:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[HORN HONKlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.43,0:22:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!\NMAN: Put that douche bag
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.09,0:22:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,on the phone.\NWALT: Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.10,0:22:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN:\NHey, am l--? Am l gonna\Nhave to come down there
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.39,0:22:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and whup your ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.89,0:22:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[SPEAKS lNDlSTlNCTLY]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.95,0:23:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And let me tell you\Nsomething else,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.36,0:23:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm not doing this\Nfor charity, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.62,0:23:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm hands down the best\Nhe's got in that office.\NHe knows it, l know it,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.45,0:23:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,l expect to be paid\Nto a level commensurate with--
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.71,0:23:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,l said, "Dave, do you think\N40 grand is a proper bonus?"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.04,0:23:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's less than 1 0 percent\Nof what l booked for you guys\Nthis quarter. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.34,0:23:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm not gonna sit here\Nand be disrespect--
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.67,0:23:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's shitting bricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.01,0:23:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you know he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.55,0:23:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that man lives in fear\Nl'll go across town--
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.22,0:23:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, l could go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.72,0:23:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoffman, Gordon Bradley,\Nor Sorcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.43,0:23:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Goldberg-Wayne.\NThey'd make me a partner\Nat Goldberg-Wayne
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.56,0:23:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,just for walking\Nin the damn door,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.94,0:23:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,that's how ecstatic they'd be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.23,0:23:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,WOMAN 1 :\NNext customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.48,0:23:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[lN HlGH-PlTCHED VOlCE]\NHells, yes, brother man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.86,0:23:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[lN NORMAL TONE]\NDude, you should check\Nthis chick out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.70,0:23:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Who? No.\NBuddy, she's a cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.20,0:23:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Stacey's a cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.20,0:23:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We're talking major\Nbarnyard boo-hog.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.41,0:23:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Roll her in flour\Nand look for the wet spot
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.33,0:23:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,before you hit that, man,\Nyou know what l'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.75,0:24:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That kind of stink\Ndoes not wash off.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.55,0:24:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir?\NMAN: Ha-ha-ha. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.26,0:24:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,WOMAN 2:\NSir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.84,0:24:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN:\NOh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.14,0:24:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Hi.\NMAN: Yeah. Oh, totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.85,0:24:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,WOMAN 2:\NHi. What can l do\Nfor you today?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.60,0:24:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN:\NWhich dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.77,0:24:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude that looks like a lizard?\NWOMAN 1 : Next in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.10,0:24:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,l, um...\NMAN: He limps like some leper.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.15,0:24:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,l-- l'm sorry.\Nl-- l would like--
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.23,0:24:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN:\NGrosses me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.44,0:24:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,a cashier's check\Nin the full amount,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.73,0:24:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,made out to Oncology Partners\Nof New Mexico, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.86,0:24:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's O-N-C-O-L-O-G-Y.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.83,0:24:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.67,0:24:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN:\Nl don't understand why
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.33,0:24:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,they're forcing you to choose\Nbetween the piccolo and the oboe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.04,0:24:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You show so much promise\Nwith both.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.09,0:24:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They say they can't\Nhave any switching\Nbetween woodwinds.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.59,0:24:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Because no matter\Nhow they divide it up,\Nsomeone would be left out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.13,0:24:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, rules are rules, l guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.10,0:24:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN:\NSure, rules are rules.\Nl'm all for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.06,0:24:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But l'm telling you,\Nyou really shine on that oboe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.64,0:24:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You have real talent,\Nand l'm not just saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.02,0:25:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.98,0:25:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Mr. Pemberton?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.65,0:25:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,ls he giving you\Nenough individual attention?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.11,0:25:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,l'd have to say so.\NHe tries to talk\Nto each one of us
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.57,0:25:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,at least once\Nduring every practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.41,0:25:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good.\NFeedback's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.99,0:25:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's key, l think.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.29,0:25:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, so how was\Nsoccer practice?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.25,0:25:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,[METAL CLANGS]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.04,0:25:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,l think that was\Nin our backyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.71,0:25:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,[CLASSlCAL MUSlC\NPLAYlNG ON STEREO]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.34,0:25:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.60,0:25:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.35,0:25:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing\Nout here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.86,0:25:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.36,0:25:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHUCKLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.69,0:25:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.28,0:25:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Jake.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.28,0:25:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Got new patio furniture.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.62,0:25:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Right on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.41,0:25:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[GRUNTS]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.79,0:26:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Heh-heh. My leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.42,0:26:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[GRUNTS]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.13,0:26:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.30,0:26:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.73,0:27:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,MRS. PlNKMAN:\NWhat do you think it could be?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.36,0:27:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,God knows l'm no expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.82,0:27:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't know. Uppers, downers?\NYour guess is as good as mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.66,0:27:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,l think we should check\Nhis arms for needle marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.79,0:27:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.75,0:27:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we let him stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.08,0:27:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The Presbyterian Church\Nhas those meetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.34,0:27:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So maybe on condition, you know?\Nlf he agrees to attend.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.34,0:27:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,l-- l just don't know\Nwhat to tell Jake.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.18,0:27:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,[FOOTSTEPS APPROACHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.56,0:27:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.73,0:27:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.90,0:27:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?\NSleep well?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.48,0:27:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What time's, uh--?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.11,0:27:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What time is dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.78,0:27:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,ln about an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.03,0:28:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, l could, uh, wash\Nthose clothes if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.29,0:28:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,They look a little lived in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.50,0:28:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, um, no, that's cool.\NYeah, maybe later.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.55,0:28:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We are not doing this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.43,0:28:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Adam--\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.39,0:28:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We said we'd lay down the law,\Nwe lay down the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.72,0:28:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to be\Nconsistent about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.89,0:29:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,[DOOR CLOSES]
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.48,0:29:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.07,0:29:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT:\NYou're, uh--
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.86,0:29:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not taking the bus?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.24,0:29:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.37,0:29:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Well, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.62,0:29:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, give me\Nmaybe another 20 minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.58,0:29:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and we'll get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.37,0:29:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.42,0:29:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.67,0:29:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.82,0:30:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, l--\Nl just think that, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.12,0:30:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,things have a way\Nof working themselves out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.32,0:30:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE:\NWow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.94,0:30:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you, uh--?\NWhen did you get this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.24,0:30:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Last May\Nat the year-end assembly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.66,0:30:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They gave me that one too.\NThe one on the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.83,0:30:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Environmental\NConsciousness Award.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.71,0:30:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that mean?\NWhat, you, like,\Nrecycle cans and shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.75,0:30:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,l contacted\NThe Albuquerque Journal
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.71,0:31:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and asked what kind of chemicals\Nthey use to bleach their paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.71,0:31:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They wound up writing\Nan article about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.34,0:31:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Right on, little bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.01,0:31:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Making mad inroads\Nwith the business community.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.01,0:31:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.81,0:31:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, hey, remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.81,0:31:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,not all learning\Ncomes out of books.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.98,0:31:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHUCKLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.23,0:31:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.28,0:31:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, we should--\NWe should hang out\Nmore often.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.36,0:31:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, just, uh--\NJust kick back and chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.82,0:31:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, if you ever,\Nlike, l don't know,\Nneed advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.08,0:31:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Because, you know,\Nl've been--
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.50,0:31:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,l've been through it all.\NFor real.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.21,0:31:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, man, you, uh--?\NYou play the flute?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.13,0:31:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's a piccolo, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.72,0:31:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, play some, uh--\NPlay some Jethro Tull.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.22,0:31:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[KNOCKlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.77,0:31:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys,\Nhow we doing in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.27,0:31:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We're, uh-- We're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.86,0:32:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Jake?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.36,0:32:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Fine, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.90,0:32:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's good.\NThat's-- That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.04,0:32:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, what the hell?\NYou see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.58,0:32:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What am l,\Nsome criminal or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.25,0:32:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.59,0:32:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.26,0:32:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you--?\NYou think that's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.72,0:32:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, "Oh, we can't\Nlet that scumbag
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.14,0:32:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,warp the mind\Nof our favorite son."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.39,0:32:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm the favorite?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.06,0:32:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.02,0:32:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You're practically\Nall they ever talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.27,0:32:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.91,0:34:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHUCKLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.49,0:34:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, snap.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.71,0:34:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.00,0:34:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHUCKLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.07,0:34:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,[CELL PHONE VlBRATES]
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.78,0:34:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[BEEPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.49,0:34:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[WHlSPERS]\NYeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.95,0:34:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN:\NYo, man, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.33,0:35:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen. You know that,\Nuh--? That product?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.21,0:35:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You got any more of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.17,0:35:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, man, okay?\Nl'm done giving out freebies.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.42,0:35:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You want charity,\Ngo ask the Salvation Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.92,0:35:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no charity. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.92,0:35:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,l got this cousin,\Nhe's got him some rich friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.43,0:35:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,These dudes are in town,\Nthey're looking to party.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.39,0:35:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And your stuff is, like,\Nso sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.10,0:35:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.52,0:35:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You up for making\Nsome fat stacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.56,0:35:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Because they'll buy\Neverything you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.61,0:35:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[METAL RATTLlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.61,0:35:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[GRUNTS]
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.82,0:35:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Yes. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.62,0:35:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[DOORBELL RlNGS]
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.21,0:35:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.96,0:35:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell\Nare you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.88,0:35:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, l waited\Ntill the ball buster left.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.92,0:35:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, no offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.18,0:36:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Who sent you, huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.26,0:36:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You wearing a wire?\NHey. Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.81,0:36:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You setting me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.06,0:36:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Homo. A wire? You want a wire?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.77,0:36:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,l got a wire.\NSpeak into the mike, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.73,0:36:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's wrong\Nwith you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.44,0:36:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A wire.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.48,0:36:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.36,0:36:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So who did you tell\Nabout. . .?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.78,0:36:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody. What, are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.16,0:36:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.91,0:36:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.83,0:36:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,To, like, touch base.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.33,0:36:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Touch base?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.00,0:36:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you know, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.30,0:36:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,what they call a debrief.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.13,0:36:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we could, like--
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.05,0:36:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought we could debrief.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.01,0:36:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Debrief?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.31,0:36:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's--
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.06,0:36:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you think\Nwe need, debrief?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.52,0:36:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[LAUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.94,0:36:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, after what happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.02,0:36:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,it just seems\Nlike the thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.69,0:36:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of, you know,\Ntalk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.86,0:36:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, we can't--\NWe can't talk to anybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.12,0:37:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, th--\NThat and l wanted to, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.16,0:37:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanted to, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.50,0:37:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,tell you how much everybody digs\Nthat meth we cooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.67,0:37:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody digs the meth\Nwe cooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.63,0:37:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously. l got dudes\Nthat would give their left nut
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.88,0:37:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,for a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.34,0:37:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.01,0:37:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm just saying,\Nl mean, if you ever,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.22,0:37:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,you know, saw your way clear\Nto, um, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.44,0:37:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,you and l cooking\Na little more...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.11,0:37:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.45,0:37:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the hell off my property.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.08,0:37:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What? l'm just saying.\NGo. And don't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.08,0:37:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.71,0:37:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.\NAll right, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.00,0:37:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Four grand.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.92,0:38:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Your share\Nfrom selling that batch.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.76,0:38:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why l'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.76,0:38:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, that's right.\NHey, l didn't smoke it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.71,0:38:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Non-small-cell adenocarcinoma.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.00,0:38:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Stage 3A,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.63,0:38:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,which means it's spread from\Nthe lung to the lymph nodes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.97,0:38:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no denying\Nit's very serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.01,0:38:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But it-- ls it--?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.81,0:38:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,lt is.. .
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.43,0:38:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,curable?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.98,0:38:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,l prefer the word\N"treatable."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.48,0:38:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But the treatments we have\Nat our disposal
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.36,0:38:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,can be very effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.61,0:39:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Without making any promises,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.49,0:39:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,l can tell you\Nthat the specific course
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.15,0:39:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,of radiation and chemotherapy\Nl'm going to suggest
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.95,0:39:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,has been successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.45,0:39:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,ln certain cases,\Nit's prolonged a patient's life
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.62,0:39:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and even resulted\Nin remission.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.08,0:39:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Um, what about\Nthe side effects?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.33,0:39:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, they can be mild\Nto practically non-existent.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.05,0:39:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Or they can be\Npretty darn awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.63,0:39:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,lt varies from patient\Nto patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.17,0:39:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Typically,\Nthere's hair loss,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.97,0:39:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,which begins a couple of weeks\Nafter the start of chemotherapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.01,0:39:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You may find yourself unusually\Nfatigued, not much energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.48,0:39:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't want to\Nget out of bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.52,0:39:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You may lose weight\Ndue to reduced appetite
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.56,0:39:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and certain\Nintestinal issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.73,0:39:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Muscle aches and pains,\Ngums will get sore and bleed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.86,0:39:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And, uh, of course, there's\Nthe possibility of nausea,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.16,0:39:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,although we'll prescribe\Nan antiemetic
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.41,0:39:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and try to counteract that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.78,0:39:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[FADlNG]\NPossible kidney\Nor bladder irritation.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.00,0:39:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You may wind up with increased\Nbruising and bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.66,0:39:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There are maybe sexual symptoms.\NYour skin may become dry...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.16,0:40:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.74,0:40:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Got anything to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.50,0:40:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.59,0:40:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.96,0:40:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's not\Ngonna fly this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.59,0:40:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How many chances\Nhave we given you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.42,0:40:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times\Nhave we sat right here
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.01,0:40:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and had the same conversation\Nover and over again?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.18,0:40:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Where you look us in the eye\Nand you plead ignorance?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.89,0:40:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And you play on our emotions
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.64,0:40:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and you tell us\Nanything and everything
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.27,0:41:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,you think we wanna hear,\Njust so we'll give you\Nanother chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.11,0:41:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hm.\NAnd it makes us feel like fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.73,0:41:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.24,0:41:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough, Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.78,0:41:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.12,0:41:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.41,0:41:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,MR. PlNKMAN:\NWe are not going to\Nhave this in our house.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.50,0:41:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We need you to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.14,0:41:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[SCOFFS]
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.21,0:42:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for not telling on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.88,0:42:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, you think\Nl could have it back?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.51,0:42:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[LAUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.77,0:42:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's skunk-weed anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.25,0:42:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN [ON TV]:\NWhile 3 percent\Nare listed as unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.21,0:42:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The Air Force is aware\Nof the widely-held belief
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.96,0:42:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,that some of these\Ncould be flying saucers from...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.63,0:42:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,\Nthis is actually very hopeful.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.05,0:42:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing conclusiνe\Nin the evidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.01,0:42:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but probing and digesting\Nof information about UFOs
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.89,0:43:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,continues unceasingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.56,0:43:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.56,0:43:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,l said this is really\Nvery, very hopeful.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.36,0:43:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.86,0:43:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Defense Command in Colorado\NSprings issued an order--
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.23,0:43:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So can l\Ncall them and--?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.20,0:43:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And tell them\Nyou'll start next week?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.57,0:43:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh. ..
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.03,0:43:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Even as they did so,\Nthe military wondered whether
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.66,0:43:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,their scientific know-how\Nand their best weapons
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.41,0:43:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,would be effective\Nin any battle
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.92,0:43:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,of the Earth\Nversus the flying saucers.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.80,0:43:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,l just think that\Nwe need to discuss it
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.59,0:43:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,a little more, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.93,0:43:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What is there to discuss?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.55,0:43:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna get the best\Ntreatment, and he's the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.27,0:43:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there's the money\Ndiscussion. l think--
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.31,0:43:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No, $90,000 out of pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.06,0:43:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe more.\NSKYLER: There's a way, Walt.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.23,0:43:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's financing,\Nthere's, um, installment plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.15,0:43:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,l-- l could always go back\Nto work.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.32,0:43:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt, there's always a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.41,0:43:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.70,0:44:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Skyler, say that there is a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.91,0:44:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And we spend\Nall that money, and. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.63,0:44:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Am l supposed to leave you\Nwith all that debt?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.14,0:44:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.35,0:44:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.39,0:44:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,l just don't want\Nemotions ruling us.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.98,0:44:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe treatment\Nisn't the way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.57,0:44:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT JR. :\NThen why don't you just
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.03,0:44:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,fucking die, already?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.20,0:44:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[GASPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.07,0:44:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give up and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.88,0:44:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.77,0:45:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG VlOLENTLY]
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.37,0:45:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[HORN HONKlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.96,0:45:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, move your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.88,0:45:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, name of the guy?\NYou'll like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.63,0:45:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, dude, l'm not worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.93,0:45:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,l got the best\Nfricking attorney.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.39,0:45:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,l would not want to be\Non the other side of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.06,0:45:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got this little team\Nof ninjas, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.43,0:45:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,that go out and do forward\Noperations--
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.39,0:45:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got crap on people.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.08,0:46:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[DARONDO'S "DlDN'T l"\NPLAYlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.05,0:47:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,[ALARM BLARlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.97,0:47:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN:\NWhat the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.47,0:47:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.64,0:47:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,ATTENDANT:\NDon't go near it, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.23,0:47:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN:\NWhat--? What are you doing?\NCall somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.31,0:47:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Call the fire people.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.81,0:47:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,ATTENDANT:\NYeah. l have a fire. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.86,0:47:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN: l don't believe this.\NDo you know how much\Nl paid for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.07,0:47:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[SHOUTS]
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.62,0:47:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?
